  Source revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.
  Author: parent session <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>. Output:
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/actual-phase-grid-approximants.tex>. Status:
  draft; independent correspondence and mathematical review requested.

  <section|Interface and scope><label|interface-and-scope>

  Construct actual <verbatim|Origin> and the common <verbatim|Maker>, then
  <verbatim|Org.Grill> on the same family and extraction order. Inputs remain
  the selected <verbatim|Makes>, full same-data <verbatim|Scrim>,
  <verbatim|Stock.Tabs>, and <verbatim|CellHyp>; this chapter does not prove
  their global availability. It does prove the local approximation and pair
  receipts that the older phase-quantitative-producer section retained. It
  changes neither the law nor extraction order. Root tests are full-census
  moments, not single expectations.

  <section|Correspondence><label|correspondence>

  All paths below are relative to <verbatim|Lean/YM/> at the pinned revision.

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item><verbatim|Push/GRID_APPROXIMATION/Iterate.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Push.GridApprox.backTo>, <verbatim|pushTo>,
    <verbatim|backTo_bound>, <verbatim|backTo_star>, <verbatim|pushTo_dual>,
    <verbatim|pushTo_integral>, <verbatim|backTo_local>,
    <verbatim|backTo_copy>. Backward averaging retains terminal
    <verbatim|(N,p)>; it is not a freshly initialized coarse Wilson history.

    <item><verbatim|Push/GRID_APPROXIMATION/Many.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Push.GridApprox.back_cells>, <verbatim|backTo_cells>,
    <verbatim|backTo_copies>: factorization only for disjoint propagated cell
    read sets. No Wilson independence is claimed.

    <item><verbatim|Push/GRID_APPROXIMATION/Joint.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Push.GridApprox.Joint.join>, <verbatim|cutoff>,
    <verbatim|expand>, <verbatim|restored>: all subset coefficients, exact
    original partition normalization, negative old terms retained together.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Lens.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.scopes>, <verbatim|visible>,
    <verbatim|cameras>, <verbatim|lensScope>. Uniform sup bound at fixed
    depth, mask halo radius stencil+4, measurability rather than continuity
    of mask.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Sand.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.Embrace>, <verbatim|embrace>: basis Q=1,
    E=4(1+columns), quarter bias, descent rates, negative played bond, exact
    exponential and forced-profile equalities. Canonical reuse:
    <verbatim|lem:actual-marked-antilles> and paid coefficient/marched-height
    argument.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Wakes.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.chapter>; <verbatim|Window.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.window>; <verbatim|Swing.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.embracing>. The two-stage service uses
    pollinate above k, local jelly at k, finite backward density/Tale
    induction below k, same migrating census, final Vault(2,1) with action
    allowance1. This is an application of the canonical
    selected-centered-service and finite-census marked bound, not a new
    assumed approximation estimate.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Loft.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.gust_choose>, <verbatim|joins>,
    <verbatim|comes>, <verbatim|conducts>: polynomial coefficient projection
    and integral commute; exact joint coefficient restored after arbitrary
    later descent.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Block.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.spiker>, <verbatim|quakes>: centered full
    census from Work.I03 opening, occupancy1, original positive partition
    cancellation, 5 per-copy price, site count exponent4, Mth root.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/Dine.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.stockK>, <verbatim|dials>,
    <verbatim|lens_supply>, <verbatim|dine>: quarter-close basis
    invertibility; same factory terminal inverse; back_budget coefficient
    price; bounded chamber-interior approximation at arbitrary N,p.
    Coefficients may depend on N,p.

    <item><verbatim|MergeProof/South/FinalG.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.realityC>, <verbatim|inTime>,
    <verbatim|grilled>: real projection, exact weight choice, subpower column
    factors versus gain; one J=max(requested,sup references) then opened m,
    all entitled real labels and accuracies; no common fine k required for
    infinitely many labels. gamma=1/8 from
    <verbatim|Push/RELAY_DIFFERENCE/Estimate.lean>.

    <item><verbatim|Next/UV_STRESS/Atom.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Next.UVStress.Origin>, <verbatim|Maker>,
    <verbatim|budgets_at>, <verbatim|Maker.fine>, <verbatim|Maker.nearby>:
    inverse spin frames, finite frame sums, 9a_j\<less\>=a_J and margin3a_j
    for original root budgets, same chosen approximants at all cells. Include
    all Signed\<times\>Bool frames.

    <item><verbatim|Next/UV_STRESS/Layout.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Next.UVStress.replace_all>, <verbatim|root_sum>,
    <verbatim|Maker.precise>: arbitrary finite words, real product, n epsilon
    M^(n-1), all layouts bounded; injectivity required only for error. Empty
    word exact.

    <item><verbatim|Next/UV_STRESS/Cover.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.Next.UVStress.Maker.layout_hyp> (private),
    <verbatim|Maker.patrons>: integer separation before late torus limit;
    four pair types; real part of whole product; same extraction order and
    actual J-grid.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Canonical reuse / literature><label|canonical-reuse--literature>

  Read <verbatim|blueprint/background/README.md> and existing source-specific
  phase, marked calibration, centered service and finite-word replacement
  proofs. No external theorem is substituted here: finite-dimensional frame
  inversion, kernel integration, finite polynomial expansion, telescope and
  exponential versus subpower estimates are elementary and already proved
  canonically. This is a same-history specialization, not an independent
  proof route.

  <section|Open boundaries><label|open-boundaries>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Full selected-history production and exact common-data binding of
    Makes, Scrim, Tabs and CellHyp remain upstream. This chapter must not be
    used to erase those ledger obligations.

    <item>Existing phase-quantitative-producer text still describes these
    local receipts as inputs; its later integration should point here and
    keep the global paid-history boundary visible. Final ordering/notation
    pass pending.

    <item>No Lean build or transitive axiom replay was run for this
    prose-only change. Inherited source audit limitations remain unchanged.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Checks actually run><label|checks-actually-run>

  Focused source reads of all files listed above, canonical prose
  comparisons, <verbatim|git diff --check> (pass). LaTeX build, render
  inspection and independent review pending at first snapshot. Record their
  actual results after integration.

  <section|Integration validation \V 2026-11-12 11:35
  UTC><label|integration-validation--2026-11-12-1135-utc>

  Bounded independent source and mathematical review is recorded in
